PalletTown_Interior2_Text_ProfOak_1::
	.string "OAK: Hello there {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "Good of you to stop by.\p"
	.string "Let me check out your POKéDEX...$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_ProfOak_2::
	.string "OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}! It’s good of you\n"
	.string "to come all this way to KANTO.\p"
	.string "What do you think of the trainers\n"
	.string "out here?\p"
	.string "Pretty tough, huh?\p"
	.string "OAK: Ah, you’re collecting KANTO\n"
	.string "GYM BADGES.\p"
	.string "I imagine that it’s hard, but the\n"
	.string "experience is sure to help you.\p"
	.string "Come see me when you get them all.\n"
	.string "I’ll have a gift for you.\p"
	.string "Keep trying hard, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "How is your POKéDEX coming?\p"
	.string "Let’s see...$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_ProfOak_3::
	.string "OAK: Wow! That’s excellent!\n"
	.string "You collected the BADGES of GYMS in\l"
	.string "KANTO. Well done!\p"
	.string "I was right in my assessment of you.\p"
	.string "Tell you what, {PLAYER}.\n"
	.string "I’ll make arrangements so that you\l"
	.string "can go to MT.SILVER.\p"
	.string "MT.SILVER is a big mountain that\n"
	.string "is home to many wild POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It’s too dangerous for your average\n"
	.string "trainer, so it’s off limits.\p"
	.string "But we can make an exception in\n"
	.string "your case, {PLAYER}.\p"
	.string "Go up to INDIGO PLATEAU.\n"
	.string "You can reach MT.SILVER\l"
	.string "from there.$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_ProfOak_4::
	.string "The amount of progress you’ve made\n"
	.string "on your POKéDEX is:\p"
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\n"
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0xAC}1PROF. OAK’s rating:$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_ProfOak_5::
	.string "And your NATIONAL POKéDEX is:\p"
	.string "{STR_VAR_1} POKéMON seen and\n"
	.string "{STR_VAR_2} POKéMON owned.$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_ProfOak_6::
	.string "If you’re in the area,\n"
	.string "I hope you come visit again.$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_ProfOak_7::
	.string "I’ll be looking forward to seeing\n"
	.string "you fill the NATIONAL POKéDEX!$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_ProfOak_8::
	.string "Finally…\p"
	.string "You’ve finally completed the\n"
	.string "POKéDEX!\p"
	.string "It’s magnificent!\n"
	.string "Truly, this is a fantastic feat!$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_Scientist::
	.string "Don’t tell anyone, but PROF.OAK’S\n"
	.string "POKéMON TALK isn’t a live broadcast.$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_Scientist2::
	.string "The PROF’s POKéMON TALK radio\n"
	.string "program isn’t aired here in KANTO.\p"
	.string "It’s a shame--I’d like to hear it.$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_Scientist3::
	.string "Thanks to your work on the\n"
	.string "POKéDEX, the PROF’s research is\l"
	.string "coming along great.$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_RedNormal::
	.string "There’s an e-mail message on the\n"
	.string "PC.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "PROF.OAK, how is your research\n"
	.string "coming along?\p"
	.string "I’m still plugging away.\p"
	.string "I heard rumors that {PLAYER} is\n"
	.string "getting quite a reputation.\p"
	.string "I’m delighted to hear that.\p"
	.string "ELM in NEW BARK TOWN$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_Sign1::
	.string "Press START to open the MENU!$"

PalletTown_Interior2_Text_Sign2::
	.string "The SAVE option is on the MENU.\n"
	.string "Use it regularly.$"
